			},
			{
				"name": "VerifyAttachmentExists",
				"description": "Verify that an attachment with the given name exists in a related list.\r\n\r\nSearches for the attachment item by its title within the related list.\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n```javascript\r\nSfdc.VerifyAttachmentExists(\"Notes & Attachments\", \"document\");\r\n```",
