			},
			{
				"name": "SaveDom",
				"description": "Save the DOM tree of the current page to files for debugging.\r\n\r\nSaves the DOM as `domR.json` (JSON format) and `dom.xml` (XML format)\r\nin the current working directory.\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n```javascript\r\nSfdc.SaveDom();\r\n```",
